WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:18.172
Ethan was thinking hard as he walked to the playground.

2
00:00:18.173 --> 00:00:23.092
It was almost the end of summer camp, and he was sad.

3
00:00:23.093 --> 00:00:27.447
He didn't know if he'd see Mr. Dunn after camp was over.

4
00:00:27.448 --> 00:00:32.535
He wanted to give Mr. Dunn something that would show how much everyone liked camp.

5
00:00:32.536 --> 00:00:41.625
He wanted it to be something that would help Mr. Dunn to remember everyone.

6
00:00:41.626 --> 00:00:45.361
"Hey, Ethan," Mr. Dunn said cheerfully.

7
00:00:45.362 --> 00:00:48.170
"Did you bring your empty soda bottle?"

8
00:00:48.171 --> 00:00:52.115
Ethan pulled a bottle out of his backpack.

9
00:00:52.116 --> 00:00:54.271
"What is it for?"

10
00:00:54.272 --> 00:00:57.970
"We're going to use it to make a terrarium."

11
00:00:57.971 --> 00:01:01.716
Mr. Dunn held up a package of seeds.

12
00:01:01.717 --> 00:01:06.621
"Has anyone ever heard of a terrarium?" he asked.

13
00:01:06.622 --> 00:01:12.325
"Ooh, my pet frog, Gurpy, lives in a terrarium!

14
00:01:12.326 --> 00:01:16.874
Wow! Are we growing frogs, Mr. Dunn?

15
00:01:16.875 --> 00:01:20.316
Are we?" Izzie asked excitedly.

16
00:01:20.317 --> 00:01:26.077
Mr. Dunn laughed. "Terrariums can be for animals or plants.

17
00:01:26.078 --> 00:01:29.751
We're going to plant seeds in our bottles.

18
00:01:29.752 --> 00:01:33.763
Not frogs. Sorry, Izzie."

19
00:01:33.764 --> 00:01:38.964
Ethan giggled. Poor Izzie looked disappointed.

20
00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:43.581
"But first we need to get some pebbles and soil."

21
00:01:43.582 --> 00:01:47.027
Mr. Dunn held up large paper cups.

22
00:01:47.028 --> 00:01:52.809
"Let's head to the woods."

23
00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:56.625
Mr. Dunn pointed to the ground underneath a tree.

24
00:01:56.626 --> 00:02:01.594
"Here's a good place to get soil."

25
00:02:01.595 --> 00:02:06.265
Ethan stuck a cup into the soil.

26
00:02:06.266 --> 00:02:09.275
"Is it okay if we scoop up worms?"

27
00:02:09.276 --> 00:02:15.244
"A soda bottle is a pretty small home for a worm," Mr. Dunn said.

28
00:02:15.245 --> 00:02:18.835
"Let's leave the worms out here in the woods."

29
00:02:18.836 --> 00:02:24.812
Ethan nodded. Mr. Dunn always had good answers.

30
00:02:24.813 --> 00:02:28.452
The kids were ready to create their terrariums.

31
00:02:28.453 --> 00:02:33.758
"First we have to cut our bottles," said Mr. Dunn.

32
00:02:33.759 --> 00:02:37.447
"We're going to use the bottom part for planting."

33
00:02:37.448 --> 00:02:41.325
He told the campers to draw a line on the bottle.

34
00:02:41.326 --> 00:02:45.795
"Make it about 12 centimeters from the bottom."

35
00:02:45.796 --> 00:02:49.480
"Mr. Dunn likes to garden," Ethan thought.

36
00:02:49.481 --> 00:02:52.818
Maybe the campers could get Mr. Dunn a shovel.

37
00:02:52.819 --> 00:02:55.567
How much did shovels cost?

38
00:02:55.568 --> 00:03:01.207
Mr. Dunn helped everyone cut their bottles.

39
00:03:01.208 --> 00:03:06.388
Then they were ready for pebbles and soil.

40
00:03:06.389 --> 00:03:11.075
"Place one layer of pebbles on the bottom of your terrarium.

41
00:03:11.076 --> 00:03:14.421
Then fill the terrarium with soil.

42
00:03:14.422 --> 00:03:20.131
Leave about four centimeters of room at the top," said Mr. Dunn.

43
00:03:20.132 --> 00:03:22.725
"Then add seeds.

44
00:03:22.726 --> 00:03:26.796
You can grow grass, clover, or basil."

45
00:03:26.797 --> 00:03:30.512
Ethan followed Mr. Dunn's instructions.

46
00:03:30.513 --> 00:03:39.488
He sprinkled a handful of clover seeds in his terrarium and covered them with soil.

47
00:03:39.489 --> 00:03:44.179
"Now lightly water your seeds with a spray bottle.

48
00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:46.605
Don't soak the soil.

49
00:03:46.606 --> 00:03:50.884
It only needs to be moist," Mr. Dunn said.

50
00:03:50.885 --> 00:03:54.731
"I actually lost my watering can at home.

51
00:03:54.732 --> 00:04:01.279
So I've been watering my indoor plants with this spray bottle!" Mr. Dunn said.

52
00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:04.235
"That's it!" Ethan thought.

53
00:04:04.236 --> 00:04:09.610
A watering can would be the perfect gift from the Kids Central kids!

54
00:04:09.611 --> 00:04:14.452
The campers fitted the top halves of their bottles back on their terrariums.

55
00:04:14.453 --> 00:04:18.342
Ethan thought about his idea for Mr. Dunn's gift.

56
00:04:18.343 --> 00:04:21.655
The last day of camp was going to be sad.

57
00:04:21.656 --> 00:04:29.749
But when they gave Mr. Dunn the watering can, everyone would be happy!
